-- International days (UN observances and widely celebrated world days). Idempotent.
-- All dates are fixed, so they are exact. Priority 2: a religious or national festival on the same
-- date takes the homepage instead.
--
-- Awareness days (AIDS, cancer, autism, disability, mental health, no tobacco, ...) deliberately have
-- NO wishes: "Happy World Cancer Day" would be wrong. They get respectful quotes, and on those days
-- the homepage opens on the Quote tab.

